<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord I was blind; I could not see.</l><l>It’s Your light that shines through me.</l><l>Nothing can explain how bright</l><l>Like Your star that appeared that night.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Power that is a mystery;</l><l>It’s Your Spirit infusing me.</l><l>All because of God’s vast grace,</l><l>There’s this big smile on my face!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
